OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's Barney's turn to host, at The
OL,7,     FHideaway at Baxby Manor in North
OL,8,     FYorkshire. His guests are charmed
OL,9,     Fby the countryside 'Hobbit Huts',
OL,10,     Fbut hidden costs ruin things for
OL,11,     Fone pair.
OL,12,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,14,     FJodie and Enya's Hideout Hotel in
OL,15,     FHull. The guests are impressed by
OL,16,     Fthe self-catered apartments, until
OL,17,     Fa dramatic breakfast derails one
OL,18,     Fpair's stay.
