OL,5,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's payment day, and the B&Bers
OL,7,     Fdebate their differences on
OL,8,     Feverything from sleep issues to
OL,9,     Fbathroom hygiene, before the
OL,10,     Fwinning B&B is crowned.
OL,11,G1750 Car S.O.S
OL,12,     FFiat Uno Turbo: In Wellingborough,
OL,13,     FTim and Fuzz fix up one of the
OL,14,     Ffastest hatchbacks of the 80s.
OL,15,     FOwner Gerry's ill health has meant
OL,16,     Fthat his Uno has been left to rot
OL,17,     Fon his drive.
OL,18,G1850 Car S.O.S
OL,19,     FToyota Supra Mk4: Tim Shaw and
OL,20,     FFuzz Townshend restore
OL,21,     Fex-motorbike-racer Lisa's 1993
OL,22,     FToyota Supra Mk4 in Fife.
