OL,12,G0315 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FJo and Neil are starting a new
OL,14,     Flife in Lecce, southern Italy, and
OL,15,     Fwant a property that's close to
OL,16,     Fthe beach with a guest annexe.
OL,17,     FJasmine Harman shows them what
OL,18,     Ftheir #200k can buy.
